     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The program has an indentation mistake. <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print(\"Open ...\")</code> is unindented, so the statement is not a part of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">park_greet()</code> and is executed first. Then, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">park_greet()</code> is called, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print(\"Welcome ...\")</code> is executed."
    }
